WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.400
Song ready? Export it as a file anyone can play, MP3 or WAV.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.600
Choose File, Export, MP3 file.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.400
MP3 is chosen. WAV keeps every detail, MP3 is small.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:25.000
Pick the bitrate: higher sounds better. What to render: the whole song.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:30.400
Click Export. Next time, Ctrl+Shift+R opens this window.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:36.400
Done. The file is in your Music folder, ready to share.
